[statement]
As `a-candidate-whose-dependency-cannot-be-met-is-passed-over-beside-one-depending-further-up`,
where a name up the chain has two requirers: `top` needs `z` and `y`,
each of which needs `q`, and `q` needs `n`. `n` 2 needs `missing`, and
`n` 1 needs `z`, the first of the two; apk passes over `n` 2 and installs
`n` 1. Where `n` 1 needs `y` instead, apk refuses
(`a-candidate-whose-dependency-cannot-be-met-is-not-passed-over-beside-one-depending-on-the-second-of-two-requirers`).

[repository]
P:top
V:1
D:z y

P:z
V:1
D:q

P:y
V:1
D:q

P:q
V:1
D:n

P:n
V:2
D:missing

P:n
V:1
D:z

[request]
top

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install n 1
install q 1
install z 1
install y 1
install top 1
